  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-1.16.x-0967fc?labelColor=737373&style=flat-square\" width=\"134\" height=\"25\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Forge-0967fc?labelColor=737373&style=flat-square&logo=curseforge\" width=\"131\" height=\"25\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/side-Both-0967fc?labelColor=737373&style=flat-square\" width=\"84\" height=\"25\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/Stereowalker/Survive?color=0967fc&labelColor=737373&style=flat-square&label=Licence&logo=github\" width=\"150\" height=\"25\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/648116022020145203?label=&color=014980&labelColor=537DB5&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=DDE4EF&link=https://discord.gg/8MXShqa\" alt=\"Stereowalkers Discord\" width=\"121\" height=\"25\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?label=&color=014980&labelColor=537DB5&style=for-the-badge&logo=Patreon&logoColor=DDE4EF&url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api/?username=stereowalker&type=patrons\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"116\" height=\"25\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>描述</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">這是一個 API 模組，因此它不為一般玩家提供任何內容，而是專門供開發者使用。此模組僅有兩項功能：第一是讓多載體模組的開發變得尽可能簡單；第二是一套直覺易用且沒有複雜度的設定系統。我相信這類功能以前肯定有人做過，尤其是設定系統。不過，如果你打算開發下一個模組，或希望將現有模組與 UnionLib 整合，建議你查看這份&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Stereowalker/Needle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">資源</a>。我相信它會非常實用。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>支援</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">如果你想支援我，可以透過在 Patreon 上訂閱，或在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.epicgames.com%252fen-US%252fp%252fcarnage-chase-8445af\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Games</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstereowalker.itch.io%252fcarnage-chase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Itch.io</a> 購買我的遊戲。這是一款賽車遊戲，如果你喜歡這類遊戲，我相信你會玩得很開心。如果你已經購買了，非常感謝。正是因為有你們的支持，我才得以持續維護這個專案。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"kinetic.stereowalker.com\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FCcEewZ.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></span></a></p>",
